NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

This repository is derived from, and contains, third-party material. See
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for the complete list. In short:

  1. Original project (MIT)
     GUAPIXIA/Douyin_Mandatory_maximum_graphics_quality
     https://github.com/GUAPIXIA/Douyin_Mandatory_maximum_graphics_quality
     The quality-forcing approach, injection point, version fingerprinting and
     the GUI/CLI skeleton come from this project. Its MIT notice above applies
     to that material.

  2. "Douyin optimization" userscript (GPL-3.0-only)
     WhiteSevs/TamperMonkeyScript
     https://github.com/WhiteSevs/TamperMonkeyScript
     injector/vendor/douyin-optimize.js is an unmodified copy (version
     2026.10.23, author WhiteSevs), embedded under GPL-3.0.
     As a result injector/userscript.bundle.js and the packaged EXEs that
     contain it are GPL-3.0 combined works. Redistribution requires the full
     corresponding source (this repository) and the GPL-3.0 license text.

  3. Bundled UMD libraries (MIT)
     @whitesev/utils 2.15.2, @whitesev/domutils 2.0.12,
     @whitesev/pops 4.2.10, qmsg 1.7.3
     Unmodified copies under injector/vendor/, fetched by tools/fetch-vendor.ps1.

  4. Douyin client files
     This repository intentionally does NOT contain any files belonging to the
     Douyin (抖音) desktop client or any other ByteDance product. The following
     are excluded via .gitignore and are generated locally on the user's own
     machine from their own installation:

       - backup/   snapshots of the user's own preload.js / app.asar
       - work/     local scratch output produced during development

Reverse-engineering notes and version fingerprints in versions.json describe
interfaces and file hashes for interoperability purposes only.
